  "mathematicalScope": "The actual point map is ideal contraction. The comparison map on the corresponding localizations preserves the numerator and denominator and bijects the homogeneous fraction value sets at k and q*k. The direct sum hypothesis supplies a homogeneous annihilator for the injectivity proof. This is a pointwise type equivalence. The global coefficient sheaf, original 4.1, 4.2 and main remain open."
